==Daily Bonus==
===Mobile===
The player receives a Silver Ticket everyday. You get a rare ticket instead each 22nd.

Before [[Version 2.2 Update#Update 2.2.3|Version 2.2.3]] of [[Nyanko Daisensou]], players also received a Rare Ticket along with a Silver Ticket.

===[[The Battle Cats POP!|Nintendo 3DS]]===
The player receives a 10 Cat Food everyday instead of the usual Silver Ticket, however, no rare ticket is given on the 22nd of each month.

===[[The Battle Cats Unite!|Nintendo Switch]]===
The player receives a Silver Ticket and 50 Cat Food every 6 hours, however, no rare ticket is given on the 22nd of each month.

==[[Battle Cats Officers' Club]]==
The Officers' Club grants the player 30 Cat Food for up to 20 days a month, for a maximum of 600 Cat Food.
