==Other Bonuses==
During collaboration events or other special events, as well as in some other situations, there may be special bonuses, such as:
*20 or 30 [[Cat Food]] daily during an event's period
*Event Cat Stamps, often including an exclusive unit
*Rewards from Facebook/Twitter campaigns
*Gifts as apologizing for a bug or glitch fixed
*Rare Ticket after an update

